// Fibonacci Sequence in DeadmauC
// Building up those numbers like building up a drop
// Recursive like Joel's Twitter beefs

ATTACH THE MAU5HEAD

// Recursive Fibonacci function - as complex as the Cube v3
THIS IS THE HOOK fibonacci TAKING n
BREAKDOWN
    WHATS THE FUSS n QUIETER THAN 2
    THE BEAT DROPS
        SEND BACK n
    WHATEVER

    I REMEMBER a
    I REMEMBER b
    a IS NOW DROP fibonacci WITH n MINUS 1
    b IS NOW DROP fibonacci WITH n MINUS 2
    SEND BACK a LAYER WITH b
BUILDUP COMPLETE

// Print the first 15 Fibonacci numbers
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "Fibonacci Sequence (like counting Twitter beefs):"

STROBE i FROM 0 TO 14
FLASH
    I REMEMBER result
    result IS NOW DROP fibonacci WITH i
    SOME CHORDS result
    SOME CHORDS TRACK " "
UNFLASH

RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "Math is CUBE V3, haters are SKRILLEX"

